                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Purgatory is an FPS arena PvP fighting game which was dumped onto Steam by shady devs and then immediately abandoned.  Because it's multiplayer only, and the devs pulled the plug on the game, the game can't properly be played. \n\nTo make sure people know just how morally bankrupt and unethical these devs are, they offered no refunds and continue to leave the game up for sale on Steam, even though it can't be played, for over $20.   There's a special place in hell for people like this.",
